  full   [pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first card in this column, G / g e last card in this column]
  full   [H move this card to the previous column, L move this card to the next column, K rank this card up, J rank this card down, { rank this card first in its column, } rank this card last in its column]
  full   [enter open, m move this issue to another column, / find a card, M only my issues, b another board of this project, s another sprint running on this board, f filter by a person, a status, a label, F 1-9 quick filters, y copy the key, Y copy the link, o open in browser]
  full   [space pick or unpick this card, v pick every card in this column, @ assign the picked cards, + add a label to the picked cards]
  full   [c create an issue in this column, w swimlanes: none, by assignee, by parent, z fold or unfold this lane, Z fold or unfold every lane]
  full   [n next card found, N previous card found]
